      "side": 1,
      "message": "I proposed 16 buckets because retries which are 6 ms part (e.g. 200 ms v.s. 206 ms) would still produce a collision.\n\nIf 200 ms v.s. 206 ms don\u0027t cause a collision, we can further reduce collision by making buckets smaller:\n\n\t(get_time().le.lo \u0026 0x3f) * 3 * MSEC; /* 64 buckets */\n\nI suspect smaller buckets than 64 wouldn\u0027t improve the collision rate.",
